WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:04,260
London accent is real, fake, real

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,100
Do you know how long I have been in England?

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,020
But my pronunciation is not as standard as it is

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,760
And it's a pure London accent

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,680
People who haven't been there won't be able to hear it.

6
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,230
My English is not bad either

7
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:16,990
Never been in the UK

8
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,670
I really can't hear this accent.

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:23,190
Impossible. Chen Yundong, have you ever been to the UK?

10
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,360
Don't lie to me, Chen Yundong

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,480
I spent a lot of time in England

12
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,800
No one knows the difference better than me.

13
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:35,130
From your English proficiency and accent

14
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,370
and your knowledge of western food

15
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,370
I'm sure you must have been in England

16
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:39,730
And it doesn’t take long to catch your breath

17
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:43,860
Because this is definitely not what you are doing in China

18
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,100
or somewhere else

19
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,060
I’ve never been to one where I can practice it myself.

20
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:57,240
Handsome guy, let me ask you a question. Are you married?

21
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:02,230
Or do you have a girlfriend?

22
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:08,610
It doesn’t matter if you’re not married or if you don’t have a girlfriend.

23
00:01:11,290 --> 00:01:12,650
Take it easy, I'll wait for you over there

24
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:16,660
How much else is this person hiding?
